  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity PROCOFSERVICES and P0312 for Taking Action Against HIV / AIDS in OTs is a component of Taking Action Against HIV / AIDS in OTs reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;1,281,022. This project benefits Caribbean, regional. It works in the following sector(s): STD control including HIV/AIDS, Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
